      "englishText": "Avadhānī: Now Samasyā: \nnitDpyanitD hridaye madiye\nbhDtDpyabhDtD prabalDshrunetre/\nkanthepyakanthe virahe priyD sD\nbhagnDpyabhagnD mama pushpamDlD//\n(It is gone yet it is in my heart!\nIt seems to appear and disappear in front of my eyes, full of tears!\nIt is around my neck and yet it isn't, in the absence of beloved!\nIt is broken and yet it is unbroken, my garland of flowers!)\n\nMy dear (wife) my priyD is the flower-garland. Because of separation this is what happens.\n\n\nPresident: The Samasyā has been successfully completed. The Avadhānī has imagined the flower-garland as his wife. Next we will hear the Dattapadī-item.\n\nAvadhānī:\t\n\t\nyatnDd vDpi bhavatpadDbjayugali sandarshanam no bhavet\nratnDdhyam bhavadiyabhavyamukutam durDt kshanam sevyate/\nnutnDvishkritikDrini surucirD divyajjaganmangalD\npratnD te shubhamurtiradya hridaye dhDryD vrishDrdrishvara//\t\n\t\n(May we behold Thy Lotus-feet through our effort;\nThe beautiful crown on Thy head is enjoyed by us from afar.\nDiscoverer of new things, beautiful, heavenly, ancient, auspicious on earth, is Thy shining image.\n May we hold it today in our  heart chamber,\nO Vrishadrishvara !)",
      "sanskritDevanagari": "ज्ीम ूवतक बींउंजाक्तं पउचसपमे उपतंबसमए ेनतचतपेमए इनज ंसेव चवमजपबंस बींतउ  \nइवजी वf ूीपबी जीम ।अंकींदप पे ेनचचवेमक जव ेीवू.\n\nैंउंेयंए चतवइसमउए तिवउ तववज ंे ंदक ेनfिपग ेंउए उमंदे जव चनज जवहमजीमतए जव इम उंकम मदजपतम. ज्ीने ं चंतज वf ं अमतेम जव इम बवउचसमजमक. \n 3ज्ीम ।अंकीक्दप पे ं चंेेपवदंजम चवमज जवव.\n\nLपजमतंससय वदमे वूद ूंय वf इमींअपवनत.\n 5ज्ीम ेनfिपग ातपज ंसेव बंद इम वितउमक तिवउ जीम तववज ातपदज ूीपबी उमंदे बनजजपदह. भ्मतम जीम बवउउमदजंजवत चसंये ूपजी जीम ूवतक ातपज बंद इम कमतपअमक तिवउ इवजी तववजे ातप = जव कव ंदक ातपदज = जव बनज."
